<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cen bank to add liquidity in O/N repo.</title>
<headline>Czech cen bank to add liquidity in O/N repo.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Thursday it would add liquidity to the interbank market through an overnight repo tender.</p>
<p>It said no minimum yield was set in the tender. It added that deadline for bids was 10.30 a.m. (0830 GMT). The CNB did not reveal the volume to be released.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
